      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "2ca435c8-8aa7-4c9d-86b9-5cec26bba519"],
     ", a bounded or absent count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "d01ad682-bc43-42c8-b67c-248971825ae7"],
     ". The class is the same under every value; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "ed36ee11-0a3c-4f97-a6ee-e95c565071fc"],
     " and ",
